### 1. First call -> ~2 s, console shows "DB HIT"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 2. Same call again -> a few ms, no "DB HIT"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 3. Admin changes the price to 1500
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 1500 }

### 4. Customer reloads -> 1000 = the stale-data bug (before @CacheEvict)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 5. All products (productList cache)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 6. Search, 2 letters -> condition is false, never cached (always ~2 s)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?keyword=ip

### 7. Search, 6 letters -> cached after the first call
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?keyword=iphone

### 8. Search with no results -> unless = true, not cached (always ~2 s)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?keyword=nokia

### Reset the price back to 1000 between takes
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 1000 }
